  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wr 301.02 Applicability. The requirements in this chapter shall apply to:\n\n(a) Any structure which qualifies as a dam in accordance with RSA 482:2, II and that is not regulated by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission; and\n\n(b) Any roadway culvert that does not meet the parameters of Env-Wr 301.03.\n\nSource. #1716, eff 2-20-81; ss by #2207, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2900, eff 11-7-84; amd by #4399, eff 4-19-88; ss by #5080, eff 2-22-91; ss by #6462-B, eff 2-21-97; ss by #8285, INTERIM, eff 2-21-05, EXPIRES: 8-20-05; ss by #8414, eff 8-20-05; ss by #10510, eff 1-22-14; ss by #13980, eff 5-24-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wr100-900.html"
